        "original_id": "28d57d06-ea5a-58ba-bb71-23f3ef39e473",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Akira Yoshizawa, Emperor Hirohito\n- Honors: Order of the Rising Sun\n- Concepts: Shōwa era, posthumous names\n\nFacts:\n- In 1983, Emperor Hirohito awarded Akira Yoshizawa the Order of the Rising Sun, 5th class, which was one of the highest honors bestowed in Japan.\n- Shōwa was the name of the era corresponding to Emperor Hirohito's reign.\n- Upon his death, Shōwa became Emperor Hirohito's own name.",
